{"step_index":120,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-25T16:52:17Z","thinking":"Initial assessment indicates that necessary playback tools are present and functional, confirmed through successful testing of a sample stream. Network connectivity to the target device and source is also verified, establishing a baseline for addressing remaining problems. The focus shifts toward pinpointing the specific, critical issues preventing seamless operation.\n\n\nThe primary issue is the IPTV provider's limitation on simultaneous connections, triggering signal interruption. This necessitates implementing a single-stream relay server to multiplex the stream to multiple clients. This server will establish a single connection to the IPTV source, buffer the stream, and redistribute it to local and remote players, thus circumventing the connection limit.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"run_command","args":{"CommandLine":"ls -lh /home/slone/Descargas/*playlist*.m3u* 2>&1","Cwd":"/home/slone","WaitMsBeforeAsync":3000,"toolAction":"Checking playlist location","toolSummary":"Comprobar ruta del archivo M3U en Descargas"}}]}
