{"step_index":137,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-25T16:53:38Z","thinking":"Initial focus is on the `BroadcastHub` component, specifically its upstream connection management. The `User-Agent` string `IPTVSmartersPro` is confirmed to be effective based on the successful HTTP 200 response. This component will handle a single upstream connection and manage client queues.\n\n\nThe broadcast hub incorporates a buffer with a defined maximum size, ensuring real-time playback by discarding outdated data when full. Implementing automatic upstream connection termination upon client disconnection optimizes resource usage.\n\nAn HTTP server relays the live stream, status, and playlist. A local web interface is available for channel control on mobile devices.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"run_command","args":{"CommandLine":"cp /home/slone/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/slocast/slocast.py /home/slone/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/slocast/slocast.py.bak","Cwd":"/home/slone","WaitMsBeforeAsync":3000,"toolAction":"Backing up slocast.py","toolSummary":"Crear copia de seguridad slocast.py.bak"}}]}
