{"step_index":141,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-25T16:53:54Z","thinking":"The TV is active and running RTVE Play, confirming network connectivity. A Chromecast connection was established successfully, volume and app status read.\nDirectly streaming the video via its URL seems feasible given the current app state. This approach could work for VLC or IPTV applications if the target device supports direct URLs.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"run_command","args":{"CommandLine":"cat > /home/slone/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/slocast/slocast.py << 'PYEOF'\n#!/usr/bin/env python3\n\"\"\"\nSLOCast v4.0 — IPTV Player & Hub Relay Multi-Pantalla\n══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n• Monocanal Upstream (Zero Bans): El PC abre 1 única conexión al proveedor IPTV\n  y la multiplexa en red local para el PC, la Xiaomi TV y cualquier otro dispositivo.\n• Reproducción fluida en PC vía MPV embebido (sin problemas de codecs GStreamer).\n• Transmisión directa con 1 clic a Xiaomi TV (SLÖNE) vía Google Cast / Chromecast.\n• Servidor Relay HTTP en puerto 8765: compatible con VLC, Smart TV, móviles y Kodi.\n• Autocarga optimizada de la lista M3U local (40.000 canales en milisegundos).\n\"\"\"\n\nimport sys\nimport os\nimport time\nimport socket\nimport queue\nimport threading\nimport urllib.request\nimport urllib.parse\nfrom pathlib import Path\nfrom http.server import BaseHTTPRequestHandler, ThreadingHTTPServer\n\nfrom PyQt6.QtWidgets import (\n    QApplication, QMainWindow, QWidget, QHBoxLayout, QVBoxLayout,\n    QPushButton, QLabel, QStackedWidget, QLineEdit, QListWidget,\n    QSplitter, QMessageBox, QListWidgetItem, QButtonGroup, QSlider,\n    QFileDialog, QFrame, QSizePolicy, QProgressBar\n)\nfrom PyQt6.QtCore import Qt, QUrl, pyqtSignal, QThread, QTimer, QProcess\n\ntry:\n    from PyQt6.QtWebEngineWidgets import QWebEngineView\n    HAS_WEBENGINE = True\nexcept ImportError:\n    HAS_WEBENGINE = False\n\ntry:\n    import pychromecast\n    HAS_CHROMECAST = True\nexcept ImportError:\n    HAS_CHROMECAST = False\n\n# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n#  ESTILOS VISUALES SLOCAST (Dark Gold Premium)\n# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\nDARK_THEME = \"\"\"\nQMainWindow, QWidget { background: #0E0E0E; color: #E0E0E0; font-family: sans-serif; }\n#Sidebar { background: #141414; border-right: 1px solid #222; min-width: 220px; max-width: 240px; }\n#Brand { color: #FFB300; font-size: 18px; font-weight: bold; padding: 18px 14px 6px 14px; }\n#StatusBar { background: #111; border-top: 1px solid #222; padding: 6px 14px; color: #777; font-size: 12px; }\n#VideoContainer { background: #000; border-radius: 6px; }\n\nQPushButton {\n    color: #DDD; background: transparent; text-align: left;\n    padding: 11px 16px; font-size: 14px; border: none; border-radius: 6px; margin: 2px 8px;\n}\nQPushButton:hover { background: #222; color: #FFF; }\nQPushButton:checked { background: #FFB300; color: #111; font-weight: bold; }\n\nQPushButton#BtnGold {\n    background: #FFB300; color: #111; font-weight: bold; text-align: center;\n    padding: 9px 18px; border-radius: 6px; margin: 0;\n}\nQPushButton#BtnGold:hover { background: #FFC107; }\n\nQPushButton#BtnGreen {\n    background: #27AE60; color: #FFF; font-weight: bold; text-align: center;\n    padding: 9px 18px; border-radius: 6px; margin: 0;\n}\nQPushButton#BtnGreen:hover { background: #2ECC71; }\n\nQPushButton#BtnRed {\n    background: #C0392B; color: #FFF; font-weight: bold; text-align: center;\n    padding: 9px 18px; border-radius: 6px; margin: 0;\n}\nQPushButton#BtnRed:hover { background: #E74C3C; }\n\nQPushButton#BtnCtl {\n    background: #1C1C1C; color: #DDD; text-align: center;\n    padding: 7px 12px; border-radius: 5px; margin: 0 3px; min-width: 60px;\n}\nQPushButton#BtnCtl:hover { background: #282828; color: #FFF; }\n\nQLineEdit {\n    background: #181818; color: #FFF; border: 1px solid #333;\n    border-radius: 6px; padding: 8px 12px; font-size: 14px;\n}\nQLineEdit:focus { border-color: #FFB300; }\n\nQListWidget { background: #121212; color: #DDD; border: 1px solid #222; border-radius: 6px; }\nQListWidget::item { padding: 8px 10px; border-bottom: 1px solid #1A1A1A; }\nQListWidget::item:selected { background: #FFB300; color: #111; font-weight: bold; }\nQListWidget::item:hover { background: #1F1F1F; }\n\nQSlider::groove:horizontal { height: 4px; background: #2A2A2A; border-radius: 2px; }\nQSlider::handle:horizontal { background: #FFB300; width: 14px; height: 14px; margin: -5px 0; border-radius: 7px; }\nQSlider::sub-page:horizontal { background: #FFB300; border-radius: 2px; }\nQSplitter::handle { background: #181818; }\nQProgressBar { background: #1E1E1E; border-radius: 4px; text-align: center; color: #FFF; font-size: 11px; }\nQProgressBar::chunk { background: #FFB300; border-radius: 4px; }\n\"\"\"\n\n# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n#  UTILIDADES DE RED\n# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\ndef get_local_ip() -> str:\n    try:\n        s = socket.socket(socket.AF_INET, socket.SOCK_DGRAM)\n        s.connect((\"8.8.8.8\", 80))\n        ip = s.getsockname()[0]\n        s.close()\n        return ip\n    except Exception:\n        return \"127.0.0.1\"\n\nUA_IPTV = \"IPTVSmartersPro\"\n\n# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n#  BROADCAST HUB — MULTIPLEXOR MONOCANAL (Anti-Baneo)\n# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\nclass BroadcastHub:\n    \"\"\"\n    Gestiona una ÚNICA conexión continua con el proveedor IPTV y reparte\n    los paquetes de vídeo simultáneamente a todos los clientes (PC, TV, móvil).\n    Evita cortes por conexiones simultáneas no autorizadas.\n    \"\"\"\n    def __init__(self):\n        self.lock = threading.Lock()\n        self.current_url: str | None = None\n        self.channel_name: str = \"Sin canal\"\n        self.clients: set[queue.Queue] = set()\n        self.worker_thread: threading.Thread | None = None\n        self.stop_event = threading.Event()\n        self.raw_playlist: str = \"\"\n\n    def register_client(self) -> queue.Queue:\n        q = queue.Queue(maxsize=120)  # ~3.8 MB buffer\n        with self.lock:\n            self.clients.add(q)\n        return q\n\n    def unregister_client(self, q: queue.Queue):\n        with self.lock:\n            self.clients.discard(q)\n\n    def set_channel(self, url: str, name: str = \"\"):\n        with self.lock:\n            if self.current_url == url and self.worker_thread and self.worker_thread.is_alive():\n                return\n            self.current_url = url\n            self.channel_name = name or \"Canal IPTV\"\n            self.stop_event.set()\n\n        if self.worker_thread and self.worker_thread.is_alive():\n            self.worker_thread.join(timeout=0.8)\n\n        self.stop_event.clear()\n        self.worker_thread = threading.Thread(target=self._upstream_worker, args=(url,), daemon=True)\n        self.worker_thread.start()\n\n    def _upstream_worker(self, url: str):\n        headers = {\n            \"User-Agent\": UA_IPTV,\n            \"Accept\": \"*/*\",\n            \"Connection\": \"keep-alive\"\n        }\n        backoff = 1.0\n        while not self.stop_event.is_set():\n            try:\n                req = urllib.request.Request(url, headers=headers)\n                with urllib.request.urlopen(req, timeout=12) as resp:\n                    backoff = 1.0\n                    while not self.stop_event.is_set():\n                        chunk = resp.read(32768)\n                        if not chunk:\n                            break\n                        with self.lock:\n                            dead = []\n                            for q in list(self.clients):\n                                try:\n                                    if q.full():\n                                        try:\n                                            q.get_nowait()\n                                        except Exception:\n                                            pass\n                                    q.put_nowait(chunk)\n                                except Exception:\n                                    dead.append(q)\n                            for d in dead:\n                                self.clients.discard(d)\n            except Exception:\n                time.sleep(backoff)\n                backoff = min(backoff * 1.5, 5.0)\n\nHUB = BroadcastHub()\n\n# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n#  SERVIDOR HTTP RELAY (Puerto 8765)\n# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\nclass RelayHTTPHandler(BaseHTTPRequestHandler):\n    def do_GET(self):\n        p = self.path\n        if p in (\"/\", \"/status\"):\n            self._serve_web_status()\n        elif p == \"/stream\":\n            self._serve_stream()\n        elif p == \"/playlist.m3u\":\n            self._serve_playlist()\n        else:\n            self.send_error(404, \"Recurso no encontrado\")\n\n    def _serve_web_status(self):\n        ip = get_local_ip()\n        port = self.server.server_port\n        ch = HUB.channel_name\n        clients_count = len(HUB.clients)\n        html = f\"\"\"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"es\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>SLOCast Hub Relay</title>\n<style>\n  body {{ background: #0E0E0E; color: #E0E0E0; font-family: -apple-system, sans-serif; text-align: center; padding: 25px; margin: 0; }}\n  h1 {{ color: #FFB300; margin-bottom: 6px; }}\n  .box {{ background: #141414; border: 1px solid #282828; border-radius: 10px; max-width: 550px; margin: 20px auto; padding: 20px; }}\n  .url {{ background: #081608; color: #2ECC71; font-family: monospace; font-size: 16px; padding: 12px; border-radius: 6px; border: 1px solid #27AE60; word-break: break-all; margin: 15px 0; }}\n  .badge {{ background: #27AE60; color: #FFF; padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 12px; font-size: 13px; font-weight: bold; }}\n  p {{ color: #999; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5; }}\n  a.btn {{ display: inline-block; background: #FFB300; color: #111; padding: 10px 22px; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 6px; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 10px; }}\n</style></head><body>\n<h1>👑 SLOCast Hub Relay</h1>\n<p>Servidor local de emisión continua multi-pantalla</p>\n<div class=\"box\">\n  <span class=\"badge\">{'● EN DIRECTO' if HUB.current_url else '○ EN ESPERA'}</span>\n  <h3>{ch}</h3>\n  <p>Clientes conectados: <b>{clients_count}</b></p>\n  <div class=\"url\">http://{ip}:{port}/stream</div>\n  <p>Pega esta URL en VLC, Kodi o cualquier reproductor de tu Xiaomi TV o móvil para ver el mismo canal sin cortes.</p>\n  <a class=\"btn\" href=\"/stream\">▶ Reproducir en navegador</a>\n</div>\n</body></html>\"\"\"\n        self.send_response(200)\n        self.send_header(\"Content-Type\", \"text/html; charset=utf-8\")\n        self.send_header(\"Access-Control-Allow-Origin\", \"*\")\n        self.end_headers()\n        self.wfile.write(html.encode(\"utf-8\"))\n\n    def _serve_playlist(self):\n        content = HUB.raw_playlist\n        if not content:\n            self.send_error(404, \"No hay lista cargada\")\n            return\n        data = content.encode(\"utf-8\")\n        self.send_response(200)\n        self.send_header(\"Content-Type\", \"application/vnd.apple.mpegurl\")\n        self.send_header(\"Content-Length\", str(len(data)))\n        self.send_header(\"Access-Control-Allow-Origin\", \"*\")\n        self.end_headers()\n        self.wfile.write(data)\n\n    def _serve_stream(self):\n        if not HUB.current_url:\n            self.send_error(503, \"Sin canal seleccionado en SLOCast\")\n            return\n\n        client_queue = HUB.register_client()\n        try:\n            self.send_response(200)\n            self.send_header(\"Content-Type\", \"video/mp2t\")\n            self.send_header(\"Cache-Control\", \"no-cache, no-store, must-revalidate\")\n            self.send_header(\"Pragma\", \"no-cache\")\n            self.send_header(\"Access-Control-Allow-Origin\", \"*\")\n            self.end_headers()\n\n            while not HUB.stop_event.is_set():\n                try:\n                    chunk = client_queue.get(timeout=2.0)\n                    self.wfile.write(chunk)\n                except queue.Empty:\n                    if not (HUB.worker_thread and HUB.worker_thread.is_alive()):\n                        break\n                    continue\n        except (BrokenPipeError, ConnectionResetError):\n            pass\n        finally:\n            HUB.unregister_client(client_queue)\n\n    def log_message(self, format, *args):\n        pass  # Silenciar logs ruidosos en consola\n\n\nclass RelayServer:\n    PORT = 8765\n    def __init__(self):\n        self._srv: ThreadingHTTPServer | None = None\n        self.is_running = False\n\n    def start(self) -> bool:\n        if self.is_running:\n            return True\n        try:\n            self._srv = ThreadingHTTPServer((\"0.0.0.0\", self.PORT), RelayHTTPHandler)\n            threading.Thread(target=self._srv.serve_forever, daemon=True).start()\n            self.is_running = True\n            return True\n        except OSError:\n            return False\n\n    def stop(self):\n        if self._srv:\n            self._srv.shutdown()\n            self.is_running = False\n\n    @property\n    def stream_url(self) -> str:\n        return f\"http://{get_local_ip()}:{self.PORT}/stream\"\n\n    @property\n    def loopback_url(self) -> str:\n        return f\"http://127.0.0.1:{self.PORT}/stream\"\n\n# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n#  CONTROLADOR CHROMECAST / XIAOMI TV (SLÖNE)\n# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\nclass XiaomiCastController(QThread):\n    cast_status = pyqtSignal(str, bool)\n\n    def __init__(self):\n        super().__init__()\n        self.cast_device = None\n        self.is_connected = False\n        self._target_url = \"\"\n        self._target_title = \"\"\n        self._action = \"idle\"\n\n    def connect_and_play(self, url: str, title: str):\n        self._target_url = url\n        self._target_title = title\n        self._action = \"play\"\n        if not self.isRunning():\n            self.start()\n\n    def stop_cast(self):\n        self._action = \"stop\"\n        if not self.isRunning():\n            self.start()\n\n    def run(self):\n        if not HAS_CHROMECAST:\n            self.cast_status.emit(\"Módulo pychromecast no disponible\", False)\n            return\n\n        try:\n            if self._action == \"play\":\n                self.cast_status.emit(\"Conectando con Xiaomi TV...\", False)\n                casts, browser = pychromecast.get_listed_chromecasts(friendly_names=[\"SLÖNE\"])\n                if not casts:\n                    chromecasts, browser = pychromecast.get_chromecasts()\n                    casts = [c for c in chromecasts if \"xiaomi\" in c.model_name.lower() or \"mitv\" in c.model_name.lower()]\n\n                if not casts:\n                    self.cast_status.emit(\"Xiaomi TV (SLÖNE) no encontrada en la red\", False)\n                    pychromecast.discovery.stop_discovery(browser)\n                    return\n\n                cast = casts[0]\n                cast.wait()\n                mc = cast.media_controller\n                mc.play_media(self._target_url, \"video/mp2t\", title=f\"SLOCast: {self._target_title}\")\n                mc.block_until_active(timeout=5)\n                self.cast_device = cast\n                self.is_connected = True\n                self.cast_status.emit(f\"Emitiendo en Xiaomi TV: {self._target_title}\", True)\n                pychromecast.discovery.stop_discovery(browser)\n\n            elif self._action == \"stop\":\n                if self.cast_device:\n                    try:\n                        self.cast_device.media_controller.stop()\n                    except Exception:\n                        pass\n                self.is_connected = False\n                self.cast_status.emit(\"Transmisión en TV detenida\", False)\n\n        except Exception as e:\n            self.cast_status.emit(f\"Error Cast: {str(e)[:45]}\", False)\n\n# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n#  REPRODUCTOR MPV INTEGRADO\n# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\nclass MPVWidget(QWidget):\n    def __init__(self, parent=None):\n        super().__init__(parent)\n        self.setObjectName(\"VideoContainer\")\n        self.setMinimumSize(480, 320)\n        self._proc: QProcess | None = None\n        self._vol = 80\n        self._muted = False\n        self._current_url = \"\"\n\n        lay = QVBoxLayout(self)\n        lay.setContentsMargins(0, 0, 0, 0)\n        self.placeholder = QLabel(\"📺  SLOCast Player\\n\\nSelecciona un canal para comenzar\", self)\n        self.placeholder.setAlignment(Qt.AlignmentFlag.AlignCenter)\n        self.placeholder.setStyleSheet(\"color: #666; font-size: 15px; font-weight: bold; background: #000;\")\n        lay.addWidget(self.placeholder)\n\n    def play(self, stream_url: str):\n        self._current_url = stream_url\n        self.stop()\n        self.placeholder.hide()\n\n        wid = str(int(self.winId()))\n        args = [\n            f\"--wid={wid}\",\n            \"--no-terminal\",\n            \"--no-input-default-bindings\",\n            \"--cache=yes\",\n            \"--cache-secs=10\",\n            f\"--volume={self._vol}\",\n            \"--mute=no\" if not self._muted else \"--mute=yes\",\n            f\"--user-agent={UA_IPTV}\",\n            \"--no-sub\",\n            stream_url\n        ]\n        self._proc = QProcess(self)\n        self._proc.finished.connect(self._on_proc_exit)\n        self._proc.start(\"mpv\", args)\n\n    def stop(self):\n        if self._proc:\n            self._proc.write(b\"quit\\n\")\n            self._proc.waitForFinished(300)\n            self._proc.kill()\n            self._proc = None\n        self.placeholder.show()\n\n    def toggle_paus